   "url": "https://www.va.gov/northern-indiana-health-care/stories/va-deputy-secretary-visits-northern-indiana-as-part-of-fehrm-go-live/",
   "text": "We have the best doctors with us, now we will have the best tools to use with all the information to provide even better care,” he said. “This new electronic health records system is the tool the private sector is using,” Lawrence added. “Now the VA is using it. We're going to be able to adopt the latest AI and robotics that help our staff do better.",
